### API Gateway - test requests (VS Code REST Client)
### Start the gateway and the services you want to test first.

@gateway = http://localhost:5100

### 1. Gateway is alive -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/health

### 2. Every service behind the gateway -> 200 if all are up, 503 + list if some are down
GET {{gateway}}/health/all

### 3. Login through the gateway (goes to Identity) -> 200
# @name login
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "champ@test.com", "password": "12345678" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4. Forum through the gateway -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/forum/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Weather through the gateway (goes to Reminder) -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/weather
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Sensor devices through the gateway -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/sensors/devices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Rate limit: send this 11 times within a minute -> the 11th answers 429
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "nobody@test.com", "password": "wrong-password" }

### 8. Unknown path -> 404 (no route)
GET {{gateway}}/api/does-not-exist
